wolfmqtt
------------------------------------------
This is an implementation of the MQTT Client written in C for embedded use,
which supports SSL/TLS via the wolfSSL library. This library was built from the
ground up to be multi-platform, space conscience and extensible. Integrates
with wolfSSL to provide TLS support.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libwolfmqtt-devel-2.2.0-1bl1
  libwolfmqtt20-2.2.0-1bl1
  libwolfssl46-5.9.4-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libwolfssl-devel-5.9.4-1bl1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfMQTT

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfMQTT/archive/refs/tags/v2.2.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack wolfmqtt-2.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./wolfmqtt-2.2.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/wolfmqtt-2.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/wolfmqtt-2.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwolfmqtt20-2.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwolfmqtt-devel-2.2.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

